{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_74_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_74","textTraditional":"一、十有一年，春，晉殺其大夫丕鄭父。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_74_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_74","textTraditional":"稱國以殺，罪累上也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_74_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_74","textTraditional":"二、夏，公及夫人姜氏會齊侯於陽穀。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_74_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_74","textTraditional":"三、秋，八月，大雩。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_74_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_74","textTraditional":"雩，月，正也。雩得雨曰雩，不得雨曰旱。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_74_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_74","textTraditional":"四、冬，楚人伐黃。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}